      "comments": "Import the original 600 by 600 nickel Esprit scan and convert Euler degrees to radians. Source XSTEP/YSTEP and X SAMPLE/Y SAMPLE are zero, so the reader uses fallback 1-micrometer metadata; treat XY as uncalibrated pixel indices. No Bruker frame correction is asserted by this import-only quality inspection.",
