        "calculator_parameter": {
          "value": {
            "equation": "abs(\"X BEAM\"+600*\"Y BEAM\"-SourceTupleIndex)",
            "selected_group": "BrukerNi/Cell Data",
            "units": 0
          },
          "version": 1
        },
        "scalar_type_index": {
          "value": 4,
          "version": 1
        },
        "parameters_version": 2
      },
      "comments": "Compare each source tuple index with its declared 600-column beam raster index. Nonzero differences reveal that unchanged file order is not a spatially valid raster order. The width600 is source-specific, not a reusable constant.",
